@* SignatureWarning: the inline banner that asks the person to confirm a change that makes signed reviewers sign again
   (a helper of the ReviewPage and ChecklistPage units).

   The parent shows it only for the change that waits, and decides what Confirm and Cancel do. Presentation only; the
   text of the slots is built in SignatureWarning.razor.cs. The signer names are user data and are rendered as plain
   text (Razor encodes them; no raw markup). The buttons are plain buttons, not submit buttons, because the banner
   can sit inside a form. Every key value carries a stable kebab-case data-testid. *@
<div class="notice" role="alert" data-testid="signature-warning">
    <p>
        Signed reviewers will need to look again and sign again, because the report changes:
        <strong data-testid="signature-warning-slots">@SlotsText</strong>.
    </p>
    <div class="form-actions">
        <button type="button" data-testid="signature-warning-confirm" @onclick="OnConfirm">Confirm change</button>
        <button type="button" class="secondary" data-testid="signature-warning-cancel" @onclick="OnCancel">Cancel</button>
    </div>
</div>
